        "original_id": "93c1d234-9cae-5634-9b40-e31f667cd285",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jon Garth Murray, Madalyn Murray O'Hair, William \"Bill\" Murray\n- Organizations: American Atheists, Inc.\n- Roles: activist, founder, president, reverend\n\nFacts:\n- Madalyn Murray O'Hair was born on April 13, 1919, and she was an American activist who also used multiple pseudonyms, most preferably M. Bible.\n- In 1963, Madalyn Murray O'Hair founded American Atheists, Inc., and became its president.\n- Madalyn Murray O'Hair served as president of American Atheists from 1963 to 1986.\n- Jon Garth Murray was born on November 16, 1954, and he was the second son of Madalyn Murray O'Hair.\n- Jon Garth Murray was the half-brother of Reverend William \"Bill\" Murray.\n- Jon Garth Murray died on September 29, 1995.\n- Madalyn Murray O'Hair died on September 29, 1995.",
